*.md

# Local secrets and maintainer-only material must never reach the daemon as build
# context. Nothing below is copied by either Dockerfile, but context is sent whole:
# an excluded file cannot be copied into an intermediate layer by a later `COPY`,
# and cannot sit in the daemon's context cache.
.env
.env.*
**/.env*
private/

# Holds coverage output and, from the Compose mail drop, outbound account emails
# as JSON — those carry live password-reset links in cleartext.
TestResults/
